   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFRTD Rural transp. 09-11</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida st&#xf6;djer IFRTD. IFRTD genomf&#xf6;r ett program som underl&#xe4;ttar samverkan mellan individer och organisationer som &#xe4;r intresserade av fr&#xe5;gor r&#xf6;rande tillg&#xe4;nglighet, r&#xf6;rlighet, gender och h&#xe4;lsofr&#xe5;gor f&#xf6;r landsbygsdsbefolking i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder. Fr&#xe5;gorna &#xe4;r centrala f&#xf6;r att minska fattigdom och h&#xf6;la m&#xe4;nniskors livskvalitet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida supports IFRTD. IFRTD carries out a programe which provide a framework for collaboration between individuals and organisations intressted in issues of access, mobility, gender equality and health. Target group is the rural population in developing countries. These matters are central for poverty reduction and quality of life in general.</narrative>
  </description>
